# Email Extractor using Python

## Project Description
This project is a simple Python-based Email Extractor that automatically identifies and extracts email addresses from a text file using Regular Expressions.

## Features
* Reads text from an input file.
* Extracts email addresses using Regular Expressions.
* Removes duplicate email addresses.
* Displays extracted email addresses.
* Saves extracted addresses into an output file.

## Technologies Used
* Python
* Regular Expressions (re module)
* File Handling

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Run the following command:

python email_extractor.py

## Project Files
* email_extractor.py – Main Python program.
* sample_emails.txt – Input text file.
* extracted_emails.txt – Output file containing extracted emails.
